    "name": "Once Upon a Fight",
    "steam_appid": 2747670,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747670/extras/63ea4b66e6f7857642be2cff0e610887.avif?t=1737486566\" width=604 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Once Upon a Fight</strong> is a<strong> multiplayer party game</strong> featuring a broad range of <strong>characters, items, traps, arenas and diverse game modes</strong>, promising a genuine multiplayer experience that guarantees<strong> hours of fun</strong> in a gameplay that is both<strong> simple and surprising</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With an immense <strong>variety of items</strong> to destroy your opponents, get ready to send your enemies flying with<strong> bombs</strong>, squash them against walls by activating <strong>traps</strong>, and discover the most diverse combinations of <strong>powers</strong> and <strong>strategies</strong> to emerge victorious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DYNAMIC MULTIPLAYER COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747670/extras/9afe988ef4f8aeb51b64b626e115c9c4.poster.avif?t=1737486566\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747670/extras/9afe988ef4f8aeb51b64b626e115c9c4.webm?t=1737486566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747670/extras/9afe988ef4f8aeb51b64b626e115c9c4.mp4?t=1737486566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in <strong>epic player-versus-player</strong> battles with up to <strong>6 players per fight</strong>. Choose between <strong>playing solo or teaming up</strong> with your friends. Combine powers from different characters for unique strategies and combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MULTIPLE MAPS &amp; BIOMES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747670/extras/c1825b6a54cec4c01be21da498b5629f.poster.avif?t=1737486566\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747670/extras/c1825b6a54cec4c01be21da498b5629f.webm?t=1737486566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747670/extras/c1825b6a54cec4c01be21da498b5629f.mp4?t=1737486566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt your strategies to <strong>different terrains!</strong> From classic dungeons to vibrant landscapes, <strong>each setting offers a unique backdrop for multiplayer mayhem.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHARACTERS WITH UNIQUE ABILITIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747670/extras/b2d88169057e258f9ddbf6abeae9dbc9.poster.avif?t=1737486566\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747670/extras/b2d88169057e258f9ddbf6abeae9dbc9.webm?t=1737486566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747670/extras/b2d88169057e258f9ddbf6abeae9dbc9.mp4?t=1737486566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select your preferred hero from a<strong> diverse lineup of original characters</strong>, each equipped with <strong>special abilities</strong> and <strong>distinct combat styles.</strong> Unlock new characters as you progress through your journey and strive to master the unique skills of each one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747670/extras/ec362ed419e22882059cb8bb7dced03f.poster.avif?t=1737486566\" width=600 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747670/extras/ec362ed419e22882059cb8bb7dced03f.webm?t=1737486566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747670/extras/ec362ed419e22882059cb8bb7dced03f.mp4?t=1737486566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your weapons and show to everyone in <strong>your room</strong>, or if it fits better, in your <strong>virtual room</strong>, who is the<strong> best fighter!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747670/extras/63ea4b66e6f7857642be2cff0e610887.avif?t=1737486566\" width=604 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Once Upon a Fight</strong> is a<strong> multiplayer party game</strong> featuring a broad range of <strong>characters, items, traps, arenas and diverse game modes</strong>, promising a genuine multiplayer experience that guarantees<strong> hours of fun</strong> in a gameplay that is both<strong> simple and surprising</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With an immense <strong>variety of items</strong> to destroy your opponents, get ready to send your enemies flying with<strong> bombs</strong>, squash them against walls by activating <strong>traps</strong>, and discover the most diverse combinations of <strong>powers</strong> and <strong>strategies</strong> to emerge victorious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DYNAMIC MULTIPLAYER COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747670/extras/9afe988ef4f8aeb51b64b626e115c9c4.poster.avif?t=1737486566\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747670/extras/9afe988ef4f8aeb51b64b626e115c9c4.webm?t=1737486566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747670/extras/9afe988ef4f8aeb51b64b626e115c9c4.mp4?t=1737486566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in <strong>epic player-versus-player</strong> battles with up to <strong>6 players per fight</strong>. Choose between <strong>playing solo or teaming up</strong> with your friends. Combine powers from different characters for unique strategies and combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MULTIPLE MAPS &amp; BIOMES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747670/extras/c1825b6a54cec4c01be21da498b5629f.poster.avif?t=1737486566\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747670/extras/c1825b6a54cec4c01be21da498b5629f.webm?t=1737486566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747670/extras/c1825b6a54cec4c01be21da498b5629f.mp4?t=1737486566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt your strategies to <strong>different terrains!</strong> From classic dungeons to vibrant landscapes, <strong>each setting offers a unique backdrop for multiplayer mayhem.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHARACTERS WITH UNIQUE ABILITIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747670/extras/b2d88169057e258f9ddbf6abeae9dbc9.poster.avif?t=1737486566\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747670/extras/b2d88169057e258f9ddbf6abeae9dbc9.webm?t=1737486566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747670/extras/b2d88169057e258f9ddbf6abeae9dbc9.mp4?t=1737486566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select your preferred hero from a<strong> diverse lineup of original characters</strong>, each equipped with <strong>special abilities</strong> and <strong>distinct combat styles.</strong> Unlock new characters as you progress through your journey and strive to master the unique skills of each one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747670/extras/ec362ed419e22882059cb8bb7dced03f.poster.avif?t=1737486566\" width=600 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747670/extras/ec362ed419e22882059cb8bb7dced03f.webm?t=1737486566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747670/extras/ec362ed419e22882059cb8bb7dced03f.mp4?t=1737486566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your weapons and show to everyone in <strong>your room</strong>, or if it fits better, in your <strong>virtual room</strong>, who is the<strong> best fighter!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "The story of your journey has begun to be written. Choose from a variety of different characters, each with unique abilities, in this chaotic multiplayer party game set in magical and fantastical lands. Whether alone or with allies, carve your name in history for eternity in Once Upon a Fight!",
